<title>SWEDEN: ASG to cooperate with TransNatur, Rangel.</title>
<headline>ASG to cooperate with TransNatur, Rangel.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish freight forwarding company ASG AB said on Friday it will start cooperating with TransNatur in Spain and Rangel Transitarios in Portugal.</p>
<p>The deal is valid from March 24 and will encompass all ASG units in the Nordic and Baltic countries, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;ASG has for a period of time been looking for partners to strengthen the group's traffic to and from the Iberian peninsula,&quot; Alf Karlsson, head of the business unit European Road Transport, said.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
